# Story page: chrono
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = Chrono Rift
---
At the edge of the world there was a tear in it, and through the tear came yesterday.

In the Chrono Rift, the path {name} had just taken came back to follow it, a pale copy that remembered every turn. {name} found it very hard to escape its own history. So do I.

Apples there aged as {name} watched, ripening and then rotting in the time it takes to say so. Time in the rift is not a river. It is a puddle, and you are standing in it.
